        "text": "The resolver is the first July 2026 print for Total employed people age 16 and over in 'Healthcare support occupations' in CPS Table A-19, measured in thousands and not seasonally adjusted, then multiplied by 0.001. All anchors below use that same CPS occupation/NSA variant. The ledger expectedReleaseWindow ending 2026-08-06 conflicts with the official August 7 release date; the forecast remains tied to the registered target and uses the verified official date."
