        "kind": "tool",
        "tool": "official.calendar",
        "call": "Verify the July 2026 Employment Situation publication date using the BLS 2026 release calendar and latest release announcement.",
        "result": "The official calendar lists Employment Situation for July 2026 on Friday, August 7, 2026 at 8:30 AM ET; the June 2026 release repeats August 7, 2026."
